  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Ecosystem Restoration Investments in Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The coordinated and adequately funded implementation of cost-effective approaches to landscape-scale ecosystem restoration in Madagascar leads to an improvement in ecosystem health, the delivery of environmental benefits, and the enhancement of rural livelihoods.
